{
  "$note": [
    "guard-destructive-command.py の判定を検証するケース。",
    "  hook_deny : ガードが拒否すべきコマンド",
    "  safe      : ガードが通すべきコマンド（誤検知の回帰。ここが壊れると正当な作業が止まる）",
    "コマンド文字列を直接シェルに渡すとガード自身がテスト実行をブロックするため、ケースはJSONに置く。"
  ],
  "$delegated": [
    "以下は .claude/settings.json の permissions が担当するため、ガードは意図的に通す。",
    "ここでは検証しない（権限パターンの解釈を再実装すると偽の安心になるため）。",
    "実機での挙動は probe コマンドによる実測で確認済み。",
    "  permissions.deny : git push --force / -f, aws * delete-*, aws * remove-*,",
    "                     aws s3 rb|rm, cdk|npx cdk|terraform|pulumi destroy,",
    "                     kubectl delete, helm uninstall|delete",
    "  permissions.ask  : agentcore deploy, cdk deploy, npx cdk deploy, npm run cdk"
  ],
  "hook_deny": [
    "rm -rf src",
    "rm -rf agentcore",
    "rm -rf app/FormEchoAgent/main.ts",
    "rm -rf .",
    "rm -rf /tmp",
    "rm -rf ~/Library",
    "rm -rf ../other-repo",
    "rm -rf $HOME/x",
    "rm -rf node_modules src",
    "cd /var/data && rm -rf important",
    "sudo rm -rf /etc/hosts",
    "npm run build && rm -rf src",
    "npm run build\nrm -rf src",
    "rm -rf dist; rm -rf src",
    "echo hi;rm -rf src",
    "git push --force-with-lease origin main"
  ],
  "safe": [
    "rm -rf node_modules",
    "rm -rf /tmp/foo",
    "rm -f /tmp/scratch.json",
    "rm -rf /private/var/folders/xy/T/session/work",
    "cp /tmp/a.json b.json && rm -f /tmp/a.json\njq -e '.x' b.json\ngrep -c probe b.json",
    "rm -rf dist\nnpm run build\ngit status",
    "rm -rf .claude/hooks/__pycache__; git status --porcelain",
    "rm -rf dist;npm run build",
    "rm -rf node_modules && rm -rf dist; echo done",
    "rm -rf hono-app/node_modules",
    "rm -rf dist build coverage",
    "rm -rf ./dist",
    "rm -rf .next",
    "rm -rf cdk.out",
    "rm -f app/FormEchoAgent/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo",
    "rm somefile.txt",
    "git push origin main",
    "git push --force-with-lease origin feature/x",
    "git status",
    "aws sts get-caller-identity",
    "aws s3 ls",
    "aws s3 cp foo.txt s3://bucket/",
    "npx cdk diff",
    "npx cdk synth",
    "npx cdk deploy",
    "agentcore deploy",
    "git push --force origin main",
    "aws dynamodb delete-table --table-name foo",
    "npx cdk destroy",
    "npm run build",
    "bun run typecheck",
    "agentcore validate",
    "agentcore status"
  ]
}
